OL,3,GNEWSASeafront fall survivor reunites
OL,4,Awith hospital staff
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who nearly died in a fall on
OL,7,FBrighton seafront has been reunited
OL,8,Fwith some of the medical staff who
OL,9,Fcared for him.
OL,11,FNoah Rees, 26, from Peacehaven was in a
OL,12,Fcoma for six weeks at the Royal Sussex
OL,13,FCounty Hospital after falling through a
OL,14,Frailing.
OL,16,FHaving to learn to walk and talk again,
OL,17,Fhe spent 14 months in rehabilitation
OL,18,Fcentres in London and Ashford.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
