OL,3,GNEWSASeafront fall survivor reunites
OL,4,Awith hospital staff
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It was a horrible time for my family,
OL,7,Fme, my friends. The people here really
OL,8,Fhelped us all through that so we're all
OL,9,Fvery grateful for them," Rees said.
